BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  In ancient times, the God of Abundance created a sacred valley with two villages separated by ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    a mountain. Each village had a dried spring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  The God decreed: "When one village pours water into the mountain's heart, it flows to the othe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    r village tripled. The receiving village may then choose what to return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  The first villagers were cautious. They poured only a cupful, and received three cups in retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    n. The second village, grateful, returned two cups. Both villages had more than they started) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (     with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Greedy merchants heard of this magic. One merchant poured nothing, keeping all his water. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    other village received nothing and returned nothing. Both stayed thirsty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  Another merchant poured everything he had, trusting completely. He received abundant water-but) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (     the receiving village kept it all. The trusting merchant perished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  The wisest villages learned balance: give enough to show faith but not so much that betrayal d) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    estroys you. When both villages gave moderately and returned fairly, the springs flowed eter) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    nal. Their descendants remembered: trust must be earned through rounds of giving and receivi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    ng, and true abundance comes from reciprocity, not from hoarding or reckless faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  Thus cooperation was born from measured trust.) Tj ET
