BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  The First poured generously, but saw only sparse drops return through the fog. "I gave abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    tly, yet receive almost nothing!" she cried. "Adaptation is wise-I'll send less.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  The Second received what seemed meager, yet poured back more than half. But through the fog, i) Tj ET
