BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    **In fog, premature certainty is the greatest folly.**) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    Myth: **After the Storm**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    The gardener poured her third bucket, watching it vanish into fog. Then a strange thing happ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ened-the ground beneath her trembled, and the return stream ran completely dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    "A drought?" she wondered. "Or did the underground river shift? Or was this merely the worst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (       fog yet, hiding everything?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    She stood with her fourth bucket, uncertain. But then a message arrived-carved in stones tha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      t washed up: "I keep pouring. You keep pouring. The fog becomes irrelevant.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    "They wrote of mutual commitment," she realized. "Of sustained generosity creating its own t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ruth. They described both of us pouring, both of us trusting.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    She thought of her own teaching: adaptation is wisdom. But also: "One generous pour proves n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      othing. Three fair actions confirm the pattern.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    "I tested them with three pours," she said. "They responded generously twice, then silence o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      nce-perhaps the fog's cruelest trick yet. Now they ask: will I match their stated commitme) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      nt?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The sage appeared. "You face the choice: believe the drought, or believe the pattern. Believ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      e the one silence, or believe the two generous returns plus their written promise.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    The gardener lifted her bucket. "Then I choose the pattern. I pour not blindly, but because ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      twice they've shown me who they are. One storm doesn't erase two springs.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    **Trust the demonstrated pattern, not the single anomaly.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 215 of 215) Tj ET
